Description: Desktop remote access client (SSH, Serial, Telnet, FTP)
 Terminalku is a fast, lightweight desktop remote access client for network engineers and system administrators. It bundles SSH, Telnet, serial console, FTP/FTPS, and a local terminal into a single multi-tab workspace with split views, snippet macros, and passive vendor detection.

